SUMMARY:Coltrane 100: Both Directions at Once
LOCATION:Hart Plaza - Carhartt Amphitheater Stage
DESCRIPTION:Detroit Jazz Fest 2026. An all-star band assembled to mark the John Coltrane centennial\, pairing Joe Lovano with Melissa Aldana (Grammy winner and first woman to win the Thelonious Monk Competition on saxophone)\, pianist Nduduzo Makhathini\, bassist Linda May Han Oh\, and drummer Jeff "Tain" Watts\, a longtime Branford and Wynton Marsalis collaborator.
END:VEVENT
